 <h3><u>Haq ka irfan jo paya</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p><span class=userContent>hak ka irfan jo paya to ali yaad aaya<br> dil main quran samaya to ali yaad aya<br> <br> adam o noh payambar hon ya hazrat issa<span class=text_exposed_show><br> younus o khizir hon ya hazrat mossa<br> wakt unper bhi jo aaya to ali yaad aaya<br> <br> ghar tha Allah ka mojood makin koi na tha<br> koi aayega yahan yeh bhi yakeen koi na tha<br> dar jo deewar main aaya to ali yaad aaya<br> <br> sekron soorma the aur pehlwan hazaar<br> jo the khaiber main sabhi yaar magar mere yaar<br> mard ka zikar jab aaya to ali yaad aaya<br> <br> jism ke aik se do(2) tukde barabar dekhe<br> khoon ki barsaat hoyee urte hoye sar dekhe<br> ran main abbas jab aaya to ali yaad aaya<br> <br> neza o teer o tabar koi khanjar na mila<br> lakh dhoondha kahin kufaar ko lashkar na mila<br> saaf maidan nazar ayya to ali yaad aaya<br> <br> apna kuch hosh na tha itni pareshani thee<br> ghum e duniya ne mujhe ghair rukha tha phir bhi<br> haath momin se malaya to ali yaad aaya<br> <br> zikar nabiyon ka suna khoob yake baad deegar<br> main nusairi to nahin khair se walah magar<br> zikar Allah ka aaya to ali yaad aaya<br> <br> jo ke akwal e mayambar ko bhula bhaithe the<br> hum ali ko bhi nahin jante yeh kehte the<br> unko mitti main dabaya to ali yaad aaya<br> <br> kalb e baatil ko kayee tukdon main battey dekha<br> takht kia cheez hai darbar ulatte dekha<br> khutba zainab ne sunaya to ali yaad aaya<br> <br> shab e mairaj ajab baat hoyee yeh gohar<br> sunke awaz e khuda chounk uthe paighambar<br> jab nazar kuch nahin aaya to ali yaad aaya<br> <br> hak ka irfan jo paya to ali yaad aaya<br> dil main quran samaya to ali yaad aya</span></span></p> 
